    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.biovat.name=バクテリア槽
    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.biovat.tooltip=Machine Type: §eBacterial Vat, Bac Vat§r\n§bAdvanced Bio Processing\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nSome recipes require §aR§2A§aD§2I§aA§2T§aI§2O§aN§7 supplied with a §l§aRadio Hatch\nRadiation can be either a minimum requirement or an exact value\nEfficiency depends on Output Hatch fluid level\nEfficiency peaks at §d50%\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.biovat.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §65§7x§65§7x§64§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §619-45 §fStainless Steel Machine Casing\n   §632 §fAny Tiered Glass §b(Tiered)\n   §e0-1 §fRadio Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fInput Bus: §7Any casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fOutput Bus: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fOutput Hatch: §7Any casing\n   \nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.manualtrafo.name=マニュアル変圧器
    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.manualtrafo.tooltip=Machine Type: §eTransformer§r\nOperates in 4 diffrent modes:\nMode 1: Circuit 0 in controller: Direct-Upstep\nMode 2: Circuit 1 in controller: Direct-Downstep\nMode 3: Circuit 2 in controller: Tapped-Upstep (currently disabled)\nMode 4: Circuit 2 in controller: Tapped-Downstep (currently disabled)\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.manualtrafo.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§63§7x§63-10§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §60+ §fMV Machine Casing\n   §fTransformer-Winding Block: §71 Layer for each tier transformed\n   §fNickel-Zinc-Ferrite Block: §7Middle of Transformer-Winding Block\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n§f   Dynamo Hatch: §7Any top layer Casing\n   \n   Tapped Mode :\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Touching Transformer-Winding Block\n§f   Dynamo Hatch: §7Touching Transformer-Winding Block\n   Hatches touching Transformer-Winding Block must be tiered from bottom to top\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
