    S:gt.blockmachines.circuitassemblyline.name=電子回路組立ライン
    S:gt.blockmachines.circuitassemblyline.tooltip=Machine Type: §eCircuit Assembler, CAL§r\nChange Mode with Screwdriver\n§bMachine does not lose efficiency when overclocked\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§6Circuit Assembly Line Mode:\nImprint this machine with a Circuit Imprint,\nby putting the imprint in the controller\nEvery Circuit Assembly Line can only be imprinted ONCE\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§6Circuit Assembler Mode:\nDoes Circuit Assembler recipes, Minimum Length: §c5§7\nRecipe tier in Circuit Assembler mode is at most Energy Hatch tier - 1\nThis mode supports Crafting Input Buffer/Bus and allows bus separation\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.circuitassemblyline.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§62-7§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7First slice, 3rd layer\n   §e1 §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any layer 3 casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any layer 1 side casing\n   §e1-6 §fInput Bus: §7Bottom center of each slice\n   §e1 §fInput Hatch: §7Any layer 1 side casing\n   §e1 §fOutput Bus: §7Bottom center of last slice\n   \n   §9Base Structure\n   §64 §fGrate Machine Casing\n   §64 §fEV+ Tiered Glass\n   §62 §fSolid Steel Machine Casing\n   §62 §fAssembly Line Casing\n   \n   §9Each Additional §bSlice\n   §fLayer 3: §7Grate Machine Casing, Grate Machine Casing, Grate Machine Casing\n   §fLayer 2: §7EV+ Tiered Glass, Assembly Line Casing, EV+ Tiered Glass\n   §fLayer 1: §7Solid Steel Machine Casing, Input Bus, Solid Steel Machine Casing\n   \nUp to 7 total slices, each one allows for 1 more item in recipes\nProjector stack size determines §bLength\nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.coldtrap.tier.01.name=コールドトラップ I
    S:gt.blockmachines.coldtrap.tier.02.name=コールドトラップ II
