    S:gt.blockmachines.htgr.name=高温ガス冷却炉
    S:gt.blockmachines.htgr.tooltip=Machine Type: §eBreeder Reactor, HTGR§r\nUses up to §c0.14§7% of fuel per operation, §c10§7% of this value is flat and §c90§7% dependent on the formula y=1-(1-x)^3 (x is % fill level)\nMaintenance problems decrease the efficiency of cooling by §c20§7% for each issue\nUses §c1,536§7 EU/t increasing by up to §c40§7 times when lacking Helium Gas\nHelium gas increases effectiveness of heat exchangers linearly up to §c100§7% at max capacity\nThe Reactor loses §c0.05§7% helium per operation and requires at least §c10§7% helium to start operation\nOne Operation takes longer based on reactor fill level (between §c100§7s and §c1,000§7s)\nProviding coolant/water/both speeds up recipe by §c7§7%/§c3§7%/§c10§7% total recipe time/second\nThe amount of necessary fluid for maximum bonus speed scales with TRISO Balls, §c0.5§7 coolant/tick/ball and §c0.1§7 distilled water/tick/ball\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nAdded by: §a§4§lk§c§lu§6§lb§e§la§2§l6§a§l0§b§l0§3§l0§r§7 & §a§9§lPxx500§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.htgr.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §616§7x§627§7x§615§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 2nd layer\n   §6273 §fBeryllium Integrated Reactor Casing\n   §6272 §fPressure Containment Casing\n   §6164 §fTungsten Frame Box\n   §6162 §fGraphite Moderator Casing\n   §645 §fTungstensteel Pipe Casing\n   §641 §fInsulated Fluid Pipe Casing\n   §630 §fTitanium Pipe Casing\n   §624 §fCable Casing\n   §623 §fIV Machine Casing\n   §620 §fRefined Graphite Block\n   §617 §fSteel Pipe Casing\n   §63 §fPump Machine Casing\n   §62 §fMotor Machine Casing\n   §61 §fProcessor Machine Casing\n   §e1 §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any top pump casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any top pump casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Bus: §7Top of reactor (TRISO Balls)\n   §e3+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any top pump casing (helium), bottom of tall tower (coolant), top of short tower (distilled water)\n   §e1+ §fOutput Bus: §7Bottom of reactor (Burned Out TRISO Balls)\n   §e2+ §fOutput Hatch: §7Top of tall tower (hot coolant), bottom of short tower (steam)\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
