    S:gt.blockmachines.industrial.fishpond.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §eFish Trap§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nCan process (Tier + 1) * 2 recipes\nPut a numbered circuit into the input bus\nCircuit 14 for Fish\nCircuit 15 for Junk\nCircuit 16 for Treasure\nNeeds to be filled with water\nWill automatically fill water from input hatch\n§520 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
