    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.cracker.name=石油接触分解装置
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.cracker.tooltip=Machine Type: §eCracker, OCU§r\n§b-10%§7 EU Usage per §fHeating Coil§7 Tier\nMaximum of §b50%§7 EU discount\nThermally cracks heavy hydrocarbons into lighter fractions\nMore efficient than the Chemical Reactor\nGives different benefits whether it hydro or steam-cracks:\nHydro - Consumes 20% less Hydrogen and outputs 25% more cracked fluid\nSteam - Outputs 50% more cracked fluid\n(Values compared to cracking in the Chemical Reactor)\nPlace the appropriate circuit in the controller or an input bus\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.cracker.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§65§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 2nd layer\n   §618-20 §fClean Stainless Steel Machine Casing\n   §616 §fHeating Coil §b(Tiered)\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fInput Bus: §7Any middle casing\n   §e2 §fInput Hatch: §7Any middle casing (cracking fluid), any side casing (hydrocarbon)\n   §e1 §fOutput Hatch: §7Any side casing opposite the hydrocarbon\n   §fMandatory Air: §7Interior of the structure\n   \nSubchannel §bcoil§7 determines §bHeating Coil Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.decay-warehouse.name=放射性崩壊室
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.decay-warehouse.tooltip=Machine Type: §eDecay Warehouse§r\nStores a single type of radioactive isotope and allows it to decay over time\nDecay speed is dependent on the isotopes' half-lives (lower is faster)\nIsotopes decay regardless of whether the warehouse is on or powered\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nThe warehouse's capacity equals the super chest's capacity divided by §9400§7.\nThe warehouse will pull in up to §9N / 512§7 items per second,\nwhere §9N§7 is the warehouse's EU input (standard energy hatch rules)\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nRight click the controller with a screwdriver to dump stored isotopes into the output bus\nRight click the controller with a plunger to empty it\nThe warehouse's contents are §c§nvoided§7 when the controller is broken\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.decay-warehouse.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §65§7x§65§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 2nd layer\n   §648-52 §fRadiation Proof Machine Casing\n   §617 §fWater\n   §61 §fSuper/Quantum Chest §b(Tiered)\n   §e1 §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fInput Bus: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fOutput Bus: §7Any casing\n   \nThe water is a one-time-cost to prime the machine, place manually\nDo not insert isotopes into the super/quantum chest\nSubchannel §bsuper_chest§7 determines §bSuper Chest Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
