    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.em.computer.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §65-16§7x§62§7x§64§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front left, 2nd layer\n   §e1 §fUncertainty Resolver X: §7Any computer casing on the first or last slice\n   §e1+ §fOptical Transmission Connector: §7Any computer casing on the first or last slice\n   §e0+ §fOptical Reception Connector: §7Any computer casing on the first or last slice\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any computer casing on the first or last slice\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any computer casing on the first or last slice\n   §fMandatory Air: §7In front of each computer heat vent\n   \n   §9Base Structure\n   §66-17 §fComputer Casing\n   §610 §fAdvanced Computer Casing\n   §66 §fComputer Heat Vent\n   §e2 §fComputer Rack: §7Any advanced computer casing, except the outer ones\n   \n   §9Each Additional §bSlice\n   §62 §fComputer Casing\n   §62 §fAdvanced Computer Casing\n   §62 §fComputer Heat Vent\n   §e2 §fComputer Rack: §7Any advanced computer casing, except the outer ones\n   \nUse an optical reception connector to daisy-chain machines\nProjector stack size determines §bLength\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
