    S:gt.blockmachines.solartower.controller.tier.single.name=ソーラータワー
    S:gt.blockmachines.solartower.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §eSolar Tower§r\nContributing Green Energy towards the future\nSurround with rings of Solar Reflectors\nThe Reflectors increase the internal heat value of the Tower (see below for formula)\nEach Reflector ring increases tier, the first ring is required for the Tower to work\nInput: Solar Salt (Cold)\nOutput: Solar Salt (Hot)\nEvery cycle (10 seconds), heat increases and all the Cold Solar Salt is heated\nConverting Cold to Hot Solar Salt reduces heat, equal to the amount converted\nThis conversion only happens if heat >= 30000 and controller efficiency = 100%\nIf there's more Cold Salt than heat, all the heat is used up and returns to 0\nThe heat increase is most efficient at exactly half of maximum heat\nMinimum efficiency at 0 or 100000 heat, maximum efficiency at 50000\nHeat Efficiency formula: ( 7000 - [|currentHeat - 50000| ^ 0.8]) / 7000\nHeat gain per cycle: numberHeaters * heatEfficiency * (10 + bonus)\nBonus: 1 ring  = +1, 2 rings = +2, 3 rings = +4, 4 rings = +8, 5 rings = +16\nTotal number of reflectors based on how many rings are built:\n1 ring = 36, 2 rings = 88, 3 rings = 156, 4 rings = 240, 5 rings = 340\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.solartower.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §615-31§7x§615-31§7x§628§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Top center, 28th layer\n   §636/88/156/240/340 §fSolar Reflector\n   §6229-250 §fStructural Solar Casing\n   §666 §fSalt Containment Casing\n   §660 §fThermal Containment Casing\n   §660 §fThermally Insulated Casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any bottom side casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any bottom side casing\n   §e1+ §fOutput Hatch: §7Any bottom side casing\n   \nProjector stack size determines §bNumber of Rings\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.source_chamber.name=粒子源チャンバー
    S:gt.blockmachines.source_chamber.tooltip=Machine Type: §eParticle Source§r\nGenerates particle beams from specific §dsource materials\nUse a §bportable scanner §7for info about the input/output of this multiblock\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nNEI has the list of §dsource materials§7 and their stats\nRecipes are all one second long and output a single beam packet\nIncreasing the power above the §3EU/t Required§7 asymptotically approaches the §dMax Material Energy\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nParticle beams have a §5particle type§7, §9energy§7, §2focus§7, and §6rate\n§5Type§7 determines the charge, rest mass, and §9Max Particle Energy\n§9Energy§7 is the energy of the particle beam in electron volts (eV)\n§2Focus§7 is the width of the particle beam\n§6Rate§7 is the amount of particles per packet\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§9Output Beam Energy§f = min(§9Max Particle Energy§7, §eaeV§f)\nwhere §eaeV§f = §dMax Material Energy§f * (1 - 1.001^(§9-Energy Ratio§f * (§3EU/t Provided§f - §3EU/t Required§f)))\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.source_chamber.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §66§7x§65§7x§65§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §656 §fShielded Accelerator Casing\n   §652 §fShielded Accelerator Glass\n   §616 §fElectrode Casing\n   §e1 §fBeam Output Hatch: §7Back center casing\n   §e1 §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any front bottom casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any front bottom casing\n   §e1 §fInput Bus/Hatch: §7Front center casing\n   §e1 §fOutput Bus/Hatch: §7Behind controller\n   §fMandatory Air: §7Interior of the structure\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.spaceelevator.name=宇宙エレベーター
    S:gt.blockmachines.spaceelevator.tooltip=Machine Type: §eSpace Elevator§r\n§o%s\nCan be equipped with up to §a12 §7Space Elevator Modules\nMotor tier limits module tier and amount of possible modules\nEach module has its own space for IO, except energy\nEnergy is supplied to this controller and gets distributed\nStarting from §dMotor MK-III §7the structure can be expanded to fit §a24 §7modules\nMax module amount is §a6§7/§912§7/§d15§7/§618§7/§c24§7 for §aMK-I§7/§9MK-II§7/§dMK-III§7/§6MK-IV§7/§cMK-V§7 motors correspondingly\nDisabling this controller also pauses all modules\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nAdded by: §a§9§dminecraft7771§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.spaceelevator.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §635-47§7x§635-47§7x§648§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center of central column, 4th layer\n   §6620 §fSpace Elevator Support Structure\n   §688 §fSpace Elevator Motor §b(Tiered)\n   §656 §fNeutronium Frame Box\n   §61 §fSpace Elevator Cable\n   §e0+ §fOptical Reception Connector: §7Any bottom center casing\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any bottom center casing\n   §e0+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any bottom center casing\n   \n   §9Base Structure\n   §6800 §fUltra High Strength Concrete Floor\n   §6593-783 §fSpace Elevator Base Casing\n   §6360 §fSpace Elevator Internal Structure\n   §e0-12 §fSpace Elevator Module: §7Surrounding central column\n   \n   §9Extended Structure\n   §61232 §fUltra High Strength Concrete Floor\n   §6593-903 §fSpace Elevator Base Casing\n   §6548 §fSpace Elevator Internal Structure\n   §e0-24 §fSpace Elevator Module: §7Surrounding central column\n   \nSwitch to extended in the controller\nSubchannel §bmotor§7 determines §bSpace Elevator Motor Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
