    S:gt.blockmachines.supercriticalsteamturbine.name=大型超臨界蒸気タービン
    S:gt.blockmachines.supercriticalsteamturbine.tooltip=Machine Type: §eSteam Turbine, LST-SC§r\nNeeds a Turbine, place inside controller\nGenerates power from Supercritical (SC) Steam based on the turbine and fitting\nOutputs 1L of Superheated (SH) Steam for every 1L of Supercritical Steam\nUse a screwdriver to adjust the fitting of the turbine\nLoose fit increases flow in exchange for efficiency\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §a§6hugetrust§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.supercriticalsteamturbine.tooltip.32016=Machine Type: §eSteam Turbine, LST-SC§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nNeeds a Turbine, place inside controller\nUse Supercritical Steam to generate power\nOutputs 1L of SH Steam per 1L of SC Steam as well as producing power\nPower output depends on turbine and fitting\nUse screwdriver to adjust fitting of turbine\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.supercriticalsteamturbine.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §66§7x§63§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 2nd layer\n   §614 §fPBI Frame Box\n   §68-14 §fSC Turbine Casing\n   §612 §fPBI Pipe Casing\n   §e1 §fDynamo Hatch: §7Back center turbine casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any back turbine casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any back turbine casing\n   §e0+ §fOutput Hatch: §7Any back turbine casing\n   §fMandatory Air: §73x3 area in front of controller\n   \n§cDynamo cannot be greater than 4A\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.supercriticalsteamturbine.tooltip_secondary.32016=§fDimensions: §64§7x§63§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center\n   §624+ §fSC Turbine Casing\n§f   Dynamo Hatch: §7Back center\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Side centered\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Supercritical Fluid, Side centered\n§f   Output Hatch: §7Superheated Steam, Side centered\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.synchrotron.name=シンクロトロン
    S:gt.blockmachines.synchrotron.tooltip=Machine Type: §eParticle Accelerator§r\nAccelerates particle beams until they produce a photon beam from the relativistic Larmor effect\nElectrically neutral §5particles§7 and beams with less than 25 §2Focus§7 are therefore unaffected\nUse a §bportable scanner §7for info about the input/output of this multiblock\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nRequires §f32,000 L/s§7 of §bcoolant§7 to run, returns as §chot coolant\n§bLiquid Oxygen§f: 90 K\n§bLiquid Nitrogen§f: 77 K\n§bCoolant§f: 60 K\n§bSuper Coolant§f: 1 K\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nIncreasing power increases the §6Output Beam Rate\nPreserve §2Beam Focus§7 more effectively with lower temperature §bcoolant\nIncreasing the tier of the §dAntenna Casings§7 improves the efficiency of the machine\nThe §9energies§7 in the following formulae must all be in keV\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§9Output Beam Energy§f = §eIR§f * §ePower Scale Factor\nwhere §eIR§f = (§9Input Beam Energy§f)^(1.13 * (§dAntenna Tier§f)^(4/9)) / 40,000,000\nand §ePower Scale Factor§f = 1 - 0.15^(§3Total EU/t Provided§f / (30,384 * (§dAntenna Tier§f)^2.5))\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§2Output Beam Focus§f = (§2Input Beam Focus§f + §eMachine Focus§f)/2.5§7 if §2Input Beam Focus§f > §eMachine Focus\n§2Output Beam Focus§f = §2Input Beam Focus§f * §eMachine Focus§f/100§7 if §2Input Beam Focus§f <= §eMachine Focus\nwhere §eMachine Focus§f = max(10, min(90, 1.5^(12 - §bCoolant Temperature§f/40)))\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§6Output Beam Rate§f = floor(2.5^(§dAntenna Tier§f) * sqrt(§3Total EU/t Provided§f) * §6Input Beam Rate§f/15,000)\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.synchrotron.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §634§7x§636§7x§67§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 4th layer\n   §61690 §fShielded Accelerator Casing\n   §690 §fSuperconducting Coil Block\n   §664 §fNiobium Cavity Machine Casing\n   §628 §fCoolant Delivery Casing\n   §616 §fLuV+ Tiered Glass\n   §64 §fAntenna Casing §b(Tiered)\n   §e1 §fBeam Input Hatch: §7Left of controller\n   §e1 §fBeam Output Hatch: §7Right and back of controller\n   §e4 §fEnergy Hatch: §7Above each antenna casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Around controller\n   §e2 §fInput Hatch: §7Between the energy hatches\n   §e2 §fOutput Hatch: §7Opposite the input hatches\n   §fMandatory Air: §7Interior of the structure\n   \nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\nSubchannel §bantenna§7 determines §bAntenna Casing Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.target_chamber.name=ターゲットチャンバー
    S:gt.blockmachines.target_chamber.tooltip=Machine Type: §eCollision Chamber§r\nEngraves wafers with a photon beam and distinct §dMasks§7 or templates\nUse a §bportable scanner §7for info about the input/output of this multiblock\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nEngraving recipes all have their own suitable §9Beam Energy§7 range,\nminimum §2Beam Focus§7, minimum §6Beam Rate§7, and minimum §3EU/t Requirement\n§dMasks§7 also have limited durability, degrading by 1 with each engraving\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nProcessing speed is determined solely by the §6Beam Rate§7, not the §3EU/t Provided\n§fRecipe Duration = 5 seconds * §6Required Beam Rate§f / §6Input Beam Rate\nCan process the entire durability of all §dMasks§7 of one type in a single tick\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
